<title>FRANCE: AGF sees 1997 profit double 1994 level.</title>
<headline>AGF sees 1997 profit double 1994 level.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group AGF is on track to attain its objective of generating a profit in 1997 that would be double the level in 1994, Finance Director Guillaume Hannezo told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>The group, privatised in May, showed a profit of 880 million francs in 1994.</p>
<p>Earlier on Thursday it reported a first half 1996 profit of 723 million francs, up from 487 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
